module

public import ToricPower.CechComparison.AllDegreeComparison

/-!
# All-degree affine Čech comparison

For a Noetherian separated scheme and a finite affine open cover, the actual
quasicoherent sheaf cohomology agrees in every degree with the actual Čech
complex. The preceding modules construct a flasque resolution tower, prove
its Čech acyclicity, and establish the comparison by dimension shifting.

The target uses the ordinary cohomology groups and the ordinary Čech
differential; no acyclicity or comparison assertion is a premise.
-/
